Student	Seat	Calculation
2	      10	 |2-10|=8
8	      3	   |8-3|=5
Total		           13

Case 2: Sorted assignment     ------- used to find minimum number of moves needed to seat students to their nearest seat
Student	Assigned seat	Moves
Case 2: Sorted assignment
Student	Seat	Calculation
